    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On December 31st, life in the big city changes. The air is filled with the anticipation of celebration and wonder, so even going to a job you don\u2019t like doesn\u2019t seem that bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a guy named Tom, a barista at a shopping mall. His shift falls on December 31st, so he makes coffee and watches the world dive into the New Year's hustle and bustle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story filled with light humor and a heartwarming atmosphere. We hope this visual novel will give you a sense of the holiday spirit and remind you that joy can be found in the most unexpected places. Even (sorry) at work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and cozy graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute soundtrack.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On December 31st, life in the big city changes. The air is filled with the anticipation of celebration and wonder, so even going to a job you don\u2019t like doesn\u2019t seem that bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character is a guy named Tom, a barista at a shopping mall. His shift falls on December 31st, so he makes coffee and watches the world dive into the New Year's hustle and bustle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short story filled with light humor and a heartwarming atmosphere. We hope this visual novel will give you a sense of the holiday spirit and remind you that joy can be found in the most unexpected places. Even (sorry) at work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm and cozy graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute soundtrack.</p></li></ul>",
